91_1428593232605029_5938411435250090577_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uETe0os1-v8Q7kNvwGUaRQ1&_nc_oc=AdmMTF9FOvVl_4Xh4LgNZUnJIYGdP15pZyfvgctJPzfIk30_V_Xle61plgbzKY1YjXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfypkVKoaFEo3MMG98OE49leU5qvBu-he1Ql9a11Sn-WFg&oe=69AD5C54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait_trial.png", "id": "1960118271247357", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292712_1960118274580690_8087766755488103280_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ml_X_fdGN4IQ7kNvwHDOe2E&_nc_oc=AdkVuybP3Wquamf9VJdvblvQDT78QK6Ph3KQLbvkSfbVDba5nriSAfhAGw3Oih9RNJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyt4jFd2iazbrHfA9bP3sJnZKWExc_qcGPNOYS-3wBd_w&oe=69AD5E2A"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone Trial", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quick reflexes to survive.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Afterlife: Dead Zone delivers an immersive experience where you can only move physically within your designated play area, plunging you into a dark, destructive, and oppressive world.", "short_description": "Survive in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies and mutants while awaiting rescue\u2026 Can you endure in the Dead Zones?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer